        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kate Ashfield, Edgar Wright, Simon Pegg, Nick Frost\n- Films: Late Night Shopping, This Little Life, Shaun of the Dead\n- Topics: acting roles, film credits, zombie uprising\n\nFacts:\n- Kate Ashfield was born on 28 May 1972 and is an English actress.\n- Kate Ashfield is known for award-winning roles as Jody in the Anglo-German film \"Late Night Shopping\" and as Sadie MacGregor in the British film \"This Little Life.\"\n- In 2004, Kate Ashfield played Liz in the film \"Shaun of the Dead.\"\n- \"Shaun of the Dead\" is a 2004 British horror comedy film directed by Edgar Wright and written by Edgar Wright and Simon Pegg.\n- \"Shaun of the Dead\" stars Simon Pegg and Nick Frost.\n- In \"Shaun of the Dead,\" the protagonist has to cope with an apocalyptic zombie uprising.",
